{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Ndipo Debora na Baraka mwana wa Abinoamu wakaimba wimbo huu:"},{"verse":2,"text":"“Wakuu katika Israeli wanapoongoza,"},{"verse":3,"text":"“Sikieni hili, enyi wafalme!"},{"verse":4,"text":"“Ee \\nd Bwana\\nd*, ulipotoka katika Seiri,"},{"verse":5,"text":"Milima ilitetemeka mbele za \\nd Bwana\\nd*,"},{"verse":6,"text":"“Katika siku za Shamgari mwana wa Anathi,"},{"verse":7,"text":"Mashujaa walikoma katika Israeli,"},{"verse":8,"text":"Walipochagua miungu migeni,"},{"verse":9,"text":"Moyo wangu u pamoja na wakuu wa Israeli,"},{"verse":10,"text":"“Nanyi mpandao punda weupe,"},{"verse":11,"text":"juu ya sauti za waimbaji"},{"verse":12,"text":"‘Amka, amka! Debora!"},{"verse":13,"text":"“Ndipo mabaki ya watu"},{"verse":14,"text":"Kutoka Efraimu wakaja watu, ambao chimbuko lao ni Amaleki;"},{"verse":15,"text":"Wakuu wa Isakari walikuwa pamoja na Debora;"},{"verse":16,"text":"Kwa nini ulikaa katikati ya mazizi ya kondoo"},{"verse":17,"text":"Gileadi alikaa ngʼambo ya Yordani."},{"verse":18,"text":"Watu wa Zabuloni walihatarisha maisha yao,"},{"verse":19,"text":"“Wafalme walikuja na kufanya vita;"},{"verse":20,"text":"Kutoka mbinguni nyota zilipigana,"},{"verse":21,"text":"Mto wa Kishoni uliwasomba,"},{"verse":22,"text":"Ndipo kwato za farasi zikafanya mshindo:"},{"verse":23,"text":"Malaika wa \\nd Bwana\\nd* akasema, ‘Merozi alaaniwe."},{"verse":24,"text":"“Yaeli abarikiwe kuliko wanawake wote,"},{"verse":25,"text":"Aliomba maji, naye akampa maziwa;"},{"verse":26,"text":"Akanyoosha mkono wake"},{"verse":27,"text":"Aliinama miguuni pa Yaeli,"},{"verse":28,"text":"“Kupitia dirishani mamaye Sisera alichungulia;"},{"verse":29,"text":"Wanawake wenye busara"},{"verse":30,"text":"‘Je, hawapati na kugawanya nyara:"},{"verse":31,"text":"“Adui zako wote na waangamie, Ee \\nd Bwana\\nd*!"}]}